				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-7746684/anderson-robotics-installation-guide:your-new-buteo-series-m#post-4010082</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Oct 2018 19:14:08 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>OthellotheCat</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3213383</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Kirby isn't the only one doing Omega-K again!</p> <p>I hope you all enjoy what is both my first ever GoI format and the first ever Anderson Robotics GoI format!</p> <p>The design of Finn the Falcon was by me, the structure was designed by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacob-conwell" >Jacob Conwell</a></span>, and the CSS was designed by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" >Croquembouche</a></span>!</p> <p>Also, thanks to <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hot-coles" >Hot-coles</a></span>, <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/geckoguy" >geckoguy</a></span>, <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span>, <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/not-a-seagull" >not_a_seagull</a></span>, <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drchandra" >DrChandra</a></span>, <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uraniumempire" >UraniumEmpire</a></span>, and <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" >Captain Kirby</a></span> for crit!</p> <p>I hope you all enjoy!</p> 
				 	]]>
